      "side": 1,
      "message": "Subbing in for Brian as the main owner of depot_tools. I\u0027m overall a bit hesitant about this change since adding `DO NOT SUBMIT` would also bypass other presubmit checks/formatting/hooks that the user might want run. IMO DNS doesn\u0027t imply skipping all checks, despite it being experimental. and as you noted you\u0027d still need to manually add `--bypass-hooks` later anyway\n\nBut if you feel strongly about this, I recommend filing a feature request at https://b.corp.google.com/issues/new?component\u003d1456102\u0026template\u003d1922777 and seeing how many people also think this feature is worth adding",
